    "detailed_description": "Game Description:<br />\r\n3D vertical plate fixed perspective of the casual game, easy to operate.Eat small fish to accumulate points and continue to grow, pay attention to avoid red things!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow it works:<br />\r\nMove: A/D<br />\r\nSuspension: ESC<br />\r\nToggle Full Screen/Window: F11<br />\r\n<br />\r\nConditions for clearing the game:<br />\r\n1. Eat the whale after reaching 500 points.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame End Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Collision: Pufferfish/Inkjet Octopus/Shark/Torpedo.<br />\r\n2. Close the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: There is only one level, you can't save your progress, happy game!",
